cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its benchmarks, please cite the preprint below."
title: "GSHAC benchmarks and reproducibility artifact"
abstract: >-
  Benchmarks, data pipeline, and figure/table generators for GSHAC
  (Geographically Sparse Hierarchical Agglomerative Clustering). The GSHAC
  library itself is maintained separately at https://github.com/mine-the-gap/gshac
  (archived at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19567090).
